        "id": "68897716021533300b0fa1bc",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This is an excellent property. It worked particularly well for our family of 12 persons(7 adults and 5 young adults ranging from 16 to 23. The main level is particularly attractive with an excellent kitchen, a large dining area, a very large family room with large screen TV, laundry and coffee areas and a large master suite. Most of the bedrooms are on the 2nd level with another bedroom with bunkbeds and a large living area on the third floor. The only issue we had was the lack of a golf cart as the one that went with the property was in for repairs.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Excellent property and location",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
