            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "We are delighted that The Sea Section was the perfect home for your daughter's wedding. Thank you for sharing your experience; we hope to welcome you back to the Emerald Coast soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Beautiful home in a quiet community- It was the perfect place to stay for my daughter's wedding at The Chapel at Seaside. We used the 3rd floor gameroom area for doing hair and make up for bridal party and even had the dad's \"first look\" on the front porch. We'll be back!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
