            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for taking the time to share your experience. We understand how essential bikes are to a fun WaterColor vacation. We have shared this information with our bike vendor and are working with them to discuss options for improving this process for our guests. We appreciate your patience as we move through this process, and we hope to see you back at the beach again soon!",
